{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/Encave_L.png?t=1744984947\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\t\t</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Encave</strong> is a first-person survival builder set in a post-disaster world. Trapped in an underground bunker, you must explore, scavenge hidden resources, and trade with other survivors to expand your base and ensure your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build, craft, and grow your underground colony\u2014plant food, attract settlers, and develop a self-sustaining community. To protect what you\u2019ve built, design a deadly killroom within your base, fortified with traps, turrets, and barricades to fend off relentless waves of enemies descending from above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend, expand, and thrive as you transform your bunker into a fortified haven in a world where danger never stops coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/Encave_GAME_FEATURES_L.png?t=1744984947\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mine</strong> resources and carve out your underground haven</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/Encave_Mining.gif?t=1744984947\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build and upgrade a deadly killroom</strong> to trap, burn, and shred incoming enemies before they breach your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/Encave_Fighting.gif?t=1744984947\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cultivate life below ground</strong>\u2014grow and cook your own survival food</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/Encave_Growing_Food.gif?t=1744984947\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/Encave_Cooking.gif?t=1744984947\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scavenge and recycle</strong> for valuable resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/Encave_Recycle.gif?t=1744984947\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/extras/Encave_Upcoming_features_v1.png?t=1744984947\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft &amp; Build Equipment</strong> \u2013 We\u2019re refining the crafting system to let you gather resources and create essential tools, weapons, and survival gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interact with Other Survivors</strong> \u2013 Work is underway to deepen interactions, allowing you to recruit allies, build relationships, and uncover hidden stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expand Your Bunker</strong> \u2013 We\u2019re adding new construction options so you can build and upgrade rooms to improve your shelter\u2019s functionality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Assign Jobs &amp; Manage Residents</strong> \u2013 A detailed job system is being fine-tuned, enabling you to assign roles and optimize your community\u2019s survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trade &amp; Unlock Blueprints</strong> \u2013 We're improving the trading system, letting you exchange goods for blueprints to unlock advanced tools, weapons, machines, plants, and furniture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Maintain &amp; Repair</strong> \u2013 We\u2019re enhancing repair mechanics to keep your equipment and utilities functional, ensuring your bunker remains habitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>These features are actively being developed, and we can\u2019t wait to share more updates soon!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3246990?t=1744984947","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744984947","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/0c845efbb96a9de0b9f400864ff9819627f69eaf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744984947","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246990/0c845efbb96a9de0b9f400864ff9819627f69eaf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744984947","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"b